/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (De-extinction, the groundbreaking process of bringing back extinct species, marries gene editing, synthetic biology, and genome reconstruction. Colossal Biosciences spearheads this revolution with its ambitious project to restore the dire wolf, a powerful predator that has been extinct for around 10,000 years, renowned for its enormous size and strength.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
