174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Colossal steers clear of cloning from deteriorated fossil DNA, instead piecing together the dire wolf genome through comparison with contemporary relatives such as gray wolves and domesticated dogs. Through the application of CRISPR-Cas9, researchers edit embryos to include dire wolf characteristics, such as greater size, greater bone density, and ancestral behavioral traits.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
>>
