<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The project seeks to recreate ecosystems that were disturbed by the extinction of the dire wolf, introducing a keystone predator for increasing biodiversity. It also offers valuable insights into evolutionary resilience and genetic diversity. Transcending conservation, the synthetic biology methods established here have the potential to improve medicine, including targeted therapies, and agriculture, as in the creation of climate-resilient crops.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [12]
>>
