/E (The workshop provided practical training in molecular docking software and real-case studies, giving the attendees the ability to investigate computational techniques in drug discovery and bioinformatics. Sessions conducted by experts gave a glimpse of the newest tools and methods, helping to gain deeper insights into how bioinformatics fuels innovation in biotechnology. The blended format helped to make it accessible, with both in-person participants at DTU's Pragyan Hall and virtual attendees participating without any hitches.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
