274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Meet Dr. Nishant Sinha, Assistant Research Professor at the University of Missouri, Columbia and Harvard Medical School Research Scholar, who shared some of his cutting-edge biomedical research experience.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (1. What inspired your journey into immunology and healthcare research?   )
/E (1. What inspired your journey into immunology and healthcare research?   )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (My journey into immunology began to expand my understanding of the wound healing process. Immunology has allowed me to study many complex cell types, cytokines, and growth factors to develop new therapies to heal scars. It has also helped me understand the balance between inflammation and regeneration. Through this field, I hope to contribute to therapies that harness the immune system for better healing.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (4. What advice would you give to Indian students aiming for research careers in the U.S.?)
/E (4. What advice would you give to Indian students aiming for research careers in the U.S.?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (2. What are the most promising innovations in immunology today?)
/E (2. What are the most promising innovations in immunology today?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Promising innovations in immunology and healthcare include the development of biologics and cell-based therapies to treat diseases and injuries. These therapies offer personalized treatment options that modulate the immune system more precisely. From monoclonal antibodies to engineered T-cells, such innovations are changing how we approach chronic conditions and repair.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The most important part of research is being able to explain and present your data. I would advise to spend the same amount of time practicing your writing and public speaking skills as you spend doing experiments. Clear communication not only helps others understand your work but also opens doors for collaboration, funding opportunities, real-world impact, and career advancement.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (3. How will AI and data science shape the future of immunology and patient care?  )
/E (3. How will AI and data science shape the future of immunology and patient care?  )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AI will allow for the development of novel biomarkers to detect chronic conditions or diseases at an early stage. This will improve patient care and hopefully prevent debilitating conditions from manifesting. By analyzing vast datasets, AI can uncover subtle patterns that might be missed by conventional diagnostic methods.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (5. Can you share a recent exciting project going on in biotech labs?)
/E (5. Can you share a recent exciting project going on in biotech labs?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A recent exciting project in biotech labs involves developing CRISPR-based gene editing therapies to target genetic disorders. Researchers are enhancing the precision and safety of these tools to correct mutations in patient cells. This approach has potential to treat diseases with no cure and is progressing toward clinical trials.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
